Note on third-party components

This repository ships source code only. It does NOT bundle ffmpeg or Chromium.

- ffmpeg is installed on demand by `scripts/vs.py doctor --install-ffmpeg`, which vendors an
  imageio-ffmpeg build into `vendor/` (git-ignored). That build enables libx264 and is therefore
  licensed under the GPL. If you redistribute this tool together with that binary, or build a
  commercial product on top of it, review the GPL obligations first, or switch to an LGPL build.
- Chromium / Playwright (BSD), Node.js (MIT) and Python (PSF) are fetched or supplied by the user's
  own environment.
- Templates reference system fonts by name only. Microsoft YaHei and similar system fonts may not be
  redistributed; ship an open font such as Noto Sans SC / Source Han Sans (SIL OFL) instead.
